WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.526
Day 2. Touch and Count.

2
00:00:01.976 --> 00:00:09.977
Watch first. Show it with real things. The first one on the page is done for you. Then do one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:17.322
Put three small things on the table. Your child touches each one, moves it aside, and says one number for each.

4
00:00:17.772 --> 00:00:20.983
One number for each touch. Not faster, not slower.

5
00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:25.402
Then ask: how many? The answer is the last number your child said.

6
00:00:26.102 --> 00:00:29.212
If a thing is counted twice, do not count for your child.

7
00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.874
Say: touch and move. Then nothing can be counted twice.

8
00:00:33.674 --> 00:00:37.449
If your child counts again when you ask how many, ask one question.

9
00:00:37.899 --> 00:00:40.660
What was the last number you said? That is the answer.

10
00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:46.668
On the page, job one is four groups to count. Your child writes how many in the box.

11
00:00:47.118 --> 00:00:51.052
Job two: color just this many. Then count the colored ones again.

12
00:00:51.502 --> 00:00:56.116
At the end your child counts three groups for you. Mark each one, and color a star.
